DTSTAMP:20260924T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270303
SUMMARY:EXEL — zanzalintinib (XL092) + atezolizumab (Tecentriq) PDUFA decision
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:Indication: previously treated metastatic colorectal cancer\nNote: FDA extended the original 2026-12-03 target action date to 2027-03-03 after updated safety and efficacy data submitted in response to an FDA information request were classified as a major amendment. Disclosed by the company via Form 8-K (Item 8.01) filed 2026-09-11\; no standalone company PR exists — sourced via Reuters' direct quote of the filing.\nDate quality: hard (2027-03-03)\nDetails: https://risdiplam.github.io/biotech-catalyst-calendar/#/event/v16-0086\nSource: https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?CIK=EXEL&owner=exclude&action=getcompany&Find=Search
END:VEVENT
