STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:Indication: HIV pre-exposure prophylaxis\nNote: FDA accepted the NDA for the once-weekly oral formulation\, potentially the first long-acting pill for HIV prevention\; standard-review action date 2027-02-02.\nDate quality: hard (2027-02-02)\nDetails: https://risdiplam.github.io/biotech-catalyst-calendar/#/event/v16-0094\nSource: https://www.gilead.com/news/news-details/2026/u-s--fda-accepts-gileads-application-for-investigational-once-weekly-oral-yeztugo-potentially-the-first-long-acting-pill-for-hiv-prevention
