TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:Indication: MAC lung disease (newly diagnosed) — ENCORE (Phase 3b)\nNote: FDA accepted the sNDA for ARIKAYCE (amikacin liposome inhalation suspension) in MAC lung disease and granted Priority Review\; PDUFA target action date January 28\, 2027 (company PR 2026-09-21). Expands to newly diagnosed MAC and converts the 2018 accelerated approval.\nDate quality: hard (2027-01-28)\nDetails: https://risdiplam.github.io/biotech-catalyst-calendar/#/event/v16-0127\nSource: https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/fda-grants-priority-review-to-insmeds-snda-for-arikayce-amikacin-liposome-inhalation-suspension-for-treatment-of-mac-lung-disease-with-pdufa-target-action-date-set-for-january-28-2027-302884017.html
