BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:v16-0431@biotech-catalyst-calendar
DTSTAMP:20260924T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270106
SUMMARY:IBRX — ANKTIVA (nogapendekin alfa inbakicept-pmln) + BCG PDUFA decision
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:Indication: BCG-unresponsive non-muscle invasive bladder cancer with papillary disease (no CIS)\nThe FDA's decision date on ANKTIVA (nogapendekin alfa inbakicept-pmln) + BCG for BCG-unresponsive non-muscle invasive bladder cancer with papillary disease (no CIS) falls on 2027-01-06 — the agency's yes-or-no moment for ImmunityBio\, Inc.'s application.\nNote: FDA accepted the sBLA for ANKTIVA + BCG in papillary NMIBC\; PDUFA date 2027-01-06. sBLA seeks extrapolation from CIS cohort data (QUILT-3.032 Cohort A) to papillary-only disease.\nDate quality: hard (2027-01-06)\nDetails: https://risdiplam.github.io/biotech-catalyst-calendar/#/event/v16-0431\nSource: https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20260519760562/en/ImmunityBio-Announces-FDA-Acceptance-of-Supplemental-BLA-for-ANKTIVA-Plus-BCG-in-BCG-Unresponsive-Non-Muscle-Invasive-Bladder-Cancer-with-Papillary-Disease-PDUFA-Date-Set-for-January-6-2027
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:v16-0432@biotech-catalyst-calendar
DTSTAMP:20260924T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270316
SUMMARY:SkinTE (autologous cutaneous multicellular units) PDUFA decision
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:Indication: Wagner Grade 1 diabetic foot ulcers\nThe FDA's decision date on SkinTE (autologous cutaneous multicellular units) for Wagner Grade 1 diabetic foot ulcers falls on 2027-03-16 — the agency's yes-or-no moment for PolarityBio\, Inc.'s application.\nNote: Private company\; no public ticker. FDA accepted SkinTE BLA for Wagner Grade 1 diabetic foot ulcers with Priority Review (Sep 15\, 2026)\; PDUFA target action date March 16\, 2027. RMAT and Breakthrough designations.\nDate quality: hard (2027-03-16)\nDetails: https://risdiplam.github.io/biotech-catalyst-calendar/#/event/v16-0432\nSource: https://www.polaritybio.com/news/fda-accepts-skinte-bla-priority-review
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:v16-0433@biotech-catalyst-calendar
DTSTAMP:20260924T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270322
SUMMARY:MRK — ENFLONSIA (clesrovimab) PDUFA decision
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
