STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:Indication: Updated efficacy information in TKI-naive and TKI-pretreated advanced ROS1-positive non-small cell lung cancer (NSCLC)\; submission fulfills an FDA post-marketing commitment.\nThe FDA's decision date on IBTROZI (taletrectinib) for ROS1-positive non-small cell lung cancer falls on 2027-01-04 — the agency's yes-or-no moment for Nuvation Bio Inc.'s application.\nNote: FDA accepted the sNDA for IBTROZI (taletrectinib) with updated duration-of-response data in TKI-naive and TKI-pretreated advanced ROS1+ NSCLC\; target action date January 4\, 2027. Quote: "announced today that the U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA) has accepted a supplemental New Drug Application (sNDA) with updated data for IBTROZI (taletrectinib) in both TKI-naive and TKI-pretreated advanced \nDate quality: hard (2027-01-04)\nDetails: https://risdiplam.github.io/biotech-catalyst-calendar/#/event/v20-0001\nSource: https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/nuvation-bio-announces-fda-acceptance-of-supplemental-new-drug-application-for-ibtrozi-taletrectinib-with-updated-duration-of-response-in-advanced-ros1-positive-non-small-cell-lung-cancer-302763329.html
